      "label": "Advance visa; conditional exemptions",
      "n": "BOCA requires Taiwanese travellers to obtain a visa before entry through a Sao Tome mission. Tourist passports should remain valid at least six months beyond the intended stay. The visa stay is unspecified. The general US/Schengen-visa waiver and documented Sao Tome family exemption are conditional; neither is assumed. Where the residence/no-mission advance-authorisation procedure applies, approval precedes border visa affixing; it is not an unconditional arrival entitlement.",
