      "s": "gap5-05-gy-tw",
      "label": "Advance visa required; stay unconfirmed",
      "n": "BOCA expressly requires Taiwanese passport holders to apply for a Guyana visa in advance. Its mission/postal directions do not establish an unrestricted electronic or walk-up arrival entitlement. Current practical processing and permitted stay remain unconfirmed."
