      "t": "vr",
      "d": 0,
      "s": "gap5-05-iq-tw",
      "label": "Federal visa required; KRI separate",
      "n": "A federal Iraqi visa is required; BOCA directs Taiwanese travellers to Iraqi missions. Federal Law 76/2017 preserves applicable personal/treaty exceptions, including Iraqis and their children holding foreign passports; none is assumed. Electronic/arrival eligibility, stay and routine tourist issuance are not confirmed. A Kurdistan-only visa does not authorise federal territory; regional permission must be assessed separately.",
